Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 13:19:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: wire lattice strategy into portfolio; demote
 monotonicity to informational

- Add LatticeStrategy for n>=21 using the H3.2 basis + H3.3 truncation + H2 rotation
- Register it in build_default_registry so 'tree-packing solve' uses it automatically
- Add fast_ratchet to solve_portfolio post-processing
- Gatekeeper: monotonicity is now informational only (not a regression_error)
  Mixed strategies legitimately produce non-monotone side lengths at boundaries
- Update test_strategy_registry to expect (baseline, grid, lattice)
